WEBVTT

02:16:03.292 --> 02:16:04.375
He hit you?!

02:16:04.459 --> 02:16:06.709
Don't be so shocked. That's the truth.

02:16:07.459 --> 02:16:08.959
-Surya.
-Sir.

02:16:09.250 --> 02:16:12.209
Surya, I couldn't see
his face in the dark.

02:16:12.709 --> 02:16:17.125
Did you see anything to help identify him?
